    "title": "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 of the European Parliament and of the Council ...",
    "snippet": "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, also known as the Artificial Intelligence Act, establishes harmonized rules for the development, marketing, and use of AI systems within the European Union. The regulation aims to promote human-centric and trustworthy AI while ensuring a high level of protection for health, safety, fundamental rights, and environmental protection. It facilitates the free movement of ...   Summarize",
